{"id":"3a3b3e188b","t":"The Immortal Genius Spearman","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/e9c42e71d578cd241ca580d6dba83565-1-193x278.jpg","n":33,"l":33,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman"},"u":1795038514898,"desc":"ديميان، قائد في مملكة باروك، يلقى حتفه في ساحة المعركة وهو يندب ضياع فرصته في المجد. لكنه يستيقظ ليجد نفسه قد عاد سبعة عشر عامًا إلى الماضي، ومعه مجرى مانا سليم يمكّنه من ممارسة السحر. عازمًا على تغيير مصيره، يقرر هذه المرة ألا يكون ضحية لعصر الحروب، بل سيدًا له، ويسعى لبلوغ القمة وإخضاع العالم لإرادته.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","فنتازيا","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-immortal-genius-spearman|/manga/the-immortal-genius-spearman/16/"},"17":{"ml":"the-immortal-gen